          "solution": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef eb_target_and_iv(cats_train, y_train, cats_test, m: float = 10.0, alpha: float = 0.5) -> tuple[float, float, float]:\n    cats_tr = np.asarray(cats_train)\n    y_tr = np.asarray(y_train, dtype=float)\n    cats_te = np.asarray(cats_test)\n    prior = float(y_tr.mean())\n    uniq = np.unique(cats_tr)\n    eb_map = {}\n    for c in uniq:\n        mask = cats_tr == c\n        eb_map[c] = (float(y_tr[mask].sum()) + m * prior) / (float(mask.sum()) + m)\n    te_enc = np.array([eb_map.get(c, prior) for c in cats_te], dtype=float)\n    tot1, tot0, k = float(y_tr.sum()), float((1.0 - y_tr).sum()), len(uniq)\n    iv = 0.0\n    for c in uniq:\n        mask = cats_tr == c\n        p1 = (float(y_tr[mask].sum()) + alpha) / (tot1 + alpha * k)\n        p0 = (float((1.0 - y_tr[mask]).sum()) + alpha) / (tot0 + alpha * k)\n        iv += (p1 - p0) * float(np.log(p1 / p0))\n    return (round(float(te_enc[0]), 4), round(float(te_enc[-1]), 4), round(float(iv), 4))\n```"
