          "code": "import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import HistGradientBoostingRegressor\nfrom sklearn.metrics import root_mean_squared_error\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2623)\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Production Temporal Audit: Lookahead Bug rolling(7) Tanpa shift(1) & Point-in-Time Join\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# 1) Deret penjualan harian 400 hari (AR(1) + lonjakan promo + guncangan acak harian)\nn_days = 400\ndays = np.arange(n_days)\npromo = (rng.uniform(size=n_days) < 0.15).astype(float)\nsales = np.zeros(n_days)\nsales[0] = 100.0\nfor t in range(1, n_days):\n    sales[t] = 0.45 * sales[t - 1] + 55.0 + 48.0 * promo[t] + rng.normal(0.0, 26.0)\n\ndf = pd.DataFrame({\"day\": days, \"promo\": promo, \"sales\": sales})\n\n# ANTI-PATTERN: rolling(7).mean() TANPA .shift(1) -> target sales[t] ikut masuk ke rata-rata hari t!\ndf[\"roll7_leaky\"] = df[\"sales\"].rolling(7, min_periods=1).mean()\ndf[\"roll3_leaky\"] = df[\"sales\"].rolling(3, min_periods=1).mean()\n# PRODUCTION-SAFE: .shift(1).rolling(7).mean() -> HANYA memakai t-7..t-1 (zero lookahead!)\ndf[\"roll7_causal\"] = df[\"sales\"].shift(1).rolling(7, min_periods=1).mean()\ndf[\"roll3_causal\"] = df[\"sales\"].shift(1).rolling(3, min_periods=1).mean()\ndf[\"lag1_causal\"] = df[\"sales\"].shift(1)\n\nvalid = df.dropna().reset_index(drop=True)\nsplit = 300\ntr, te = valid.iloc[:split], valid.iloc[split:]\n\n# Latih model bocor (memakai roll7 & roll3 tanpa shift(1)) vs model kausal (memakai shift(1))\nm_leaky = HistGradientBoostingRegressor(max_depth=4, max_iter=80, random_state=42)\nm_leaky.fit(tr[[\"promo\", \"roll7_leaky\", \"roll3_leaky\"]], tr[\"sales\"])\nrmse_leaky_offline = root_mean_squared_error(te[\"sales\"], m_leaky.predict(te[[\"promo\", \"roll7_leaky\", \"roll3_leaky\"]]))\n\n# Saat produksi (jam 06:00 pagi), sales[t] BELUM TERJADI! Hanya fitur kausal hingga t-1 yang tersedia!\nX_te_live_for_leaky = te[[\"promo\", \"roll7_causal\", \"roll3_causal\"]].rename(\n    columns={\"roll7_causal\": \"roll7_leaky\", \"roll3_causal\": \"roll3_leaky\"}\n)\nrmse_leaky_live = root_mean_squared_error(te[\"sales\"], m_leaky.predict(X_te_live_for_leaky))\n\nm_causal = HistGradientBoostingRegressor(max_depth=4, max_iter=80, random_state=42)\nm_causal.fit(tr[[\"promo\", \"roll7_causal\", \"roll3_causal\", \"lag1_causal\"]], tr[\"sales\"])\nrmse_causal_live = root_mean_squared_error(te[\"sales\"], m_causal.predict(te[[\"promo\", \"roll7_causal\", \"roll3_causal\", \"lag1_causal\"]]))\n\n# 2) Uji Point-in-Time Join (pd.merge_asof direction='backward') untuk tabel harga yang berubah dinamis\nevents = pd.DataFrame({\n    \"event_ts\": [10, 25, 42, 68, 95],\n    \"sku\": [\"SKU_A\"] * 5,\n    \"actual_units\": [12, 18, 9, 24, 15],\n})\nprice_changelog = pd.DataFrame({\n    \"effective_ts\": [0, 30, 60, 90],\n    \"sku\": [\"SKU_A\"] * 4,\n    \"unit_price\": [50_000, 42_000, 35_000, 48_000],\n})\n\n# ANTI-PATTERN: mengambil harga terbaru (latest snapshot) untuk seluruh transaksi historis!\nlatest_price = price_changelog.sort_values(\"effective_ts\").groupby(\"sku\").last().reset_index()\nbad_join = events.merge(latest_price[[\"sku\", \"unit_price\"]], on=\"sku\")\n\n# PRODUCTION-SAFE: Point-in-Time backward as-of join (hanya melihat harga yang berlaku <= event_ts)\npit_join = pd.merge_asof(\n    events.sort_values(\"event_ts\"),\n    price_changelog.sort_values(\"effective_ts\"),\n    left_on=\"event_ts\",\n    right_on=\"effective_ts\",\n    by=\"sku\",\n    direction=\"backward\",\n)\n\n# 3) Uji Perturbasi Masa Depan (mengubah sales[t > 100] x 50 harus memberi delta 0.0 pada fitur t <= 100)\nt0 = 100\ns_orig = df[\"sales\"].copy()\ns_pert = df[\"sales\"].copy()\ns_pert.iloc[t0:] *= 50.0  # ubah mulai hari t0 (target hari t0 dan masa depan!)\n\ndelta_leaky_t0 = float(abs(s_orig.rolling(7).mean().iloc[t0] - s_pert.rolling(7).mean().iloc[t0]))\ndelta_causal_t0 = float(abs(s_orig.shift(1).rolling(7).mean().iloc[t0] - s_pert.shift(1).rolling(7).mean().iloc[t0]))\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Audit Lookahead Leakage: rolling(7) Tanpa shift(1) vs Kausal ===\")\nprint(f\"Model Bocor [Backtest Offline Palsu] : RMSE = {rmse_leaky_offline:6.2f}  <-- ILUSI AKURAT!\")\nprint(f\"Model Bocor [Deployment Live Nyata]  : RMSE = {rmse_leaky_live:6.2f}  <-- RUNTUH DI PRODUKSI!\")\nprint(f\"Model Kausal [shift(1).rolling(7)]   : RMSE = {rmse_causal_live:6.2f}  <-- JUJUR & STABIL!\")\nprint(f\"Uji Perturbasi Target Hari t0=100    : Leaky delta={delta_leaky_t0:7.2f} (BOCOR!) | Causal delta={delta_causal_t0:.2f} (AMAN)\")\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Audit Point-in-Time Join (Latest Snapshot vs pd.merge_asof backward) ===\")\nfor i in range(len(pit_join)):\n    print(f\"  ts={int(pit_join.loc[i,'event_ts']):2d} | Latest-Snapshot Bug={int(bad_join.loc[i,'unit_price']):6,d} | Point-in-Time Benar={int(pit_join.loc[i,'unit_price']):6,d} (eff_ts={int(pit_join.loc[i,'effective_ts']):2d})\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Audit Lookahead Leakage: rolling(7) Tanpa shift(1) vs Kausal ===\nModel Bocor [Backtest Offline Palsu] : RMSE =  24.36  <-- ILUSI AKURAT!\nModel Bocor [Deployment Live Nyata]  : RMSE =  36.41  <-- RUNTUH DI PRODUKSI!\nModel Kausal [shift(1).rolling(7)]   : RMSE =  29.94  <-- JUJUR & STABIL!\nUji Perturbasi Target Hari t0=100    : Leaky delta= 504.52 (BOCOR!) | Causal delta=0.00 (AMAN)\n\n=== 2. Audit Point-in-Time Join (Latest Snapshot vs pd.merge_asof backward) ===\n  ts=10 | Latest-Snapshot Bug=48,000 | Point-in-Time Benar=50,000 (eff_ts= 0)\n  ts=25 | Latest-Snapshot Bug=48,000 | Point-in-Time Benar=50,000 (eff_ts= 0)\n  ts=42 | Latest-Snapshot Bug=48,000 | Point-in-Time Benar=42,000 (eff_ts=30)\n  ts=68 | Latest-Snapshot Bug=48,000 | Point-in-Time Benar=35,000 (eff_ts=60)\n  ts=95 | Latest-Snapshot Bug=48,000 | Point-in-Time Benar=48,000 (eff_ts=90)",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Audit Lookahead Leakage: rolling(7) Tanpa shift(1) vs Kausal ===\nModel Bocor [Backtest Offline Palsu] : RMSE =  24.36  <-- ILUSI AKURAT!\nModel Bocor [Deployment Live Nyata]  : RMSE =  36.41  <-- RUNTUH DI PRODUKSI!\nModel Kausal [shift(1).rolling(7)]   : RMSE =  29.94  <-- JUJUR & STABIL!\nUji Perturbasi Target Hari t0=100    : Leaky delta= 504.52 (BOCOR!) | Causal delta=0.00 (AMAN)\n\n=== 2. Audit Point-in-Time Join (Latest Snapshot vs pd.merge_asof backward) ===\n  ts=10 | Latest-Snapshot Bug=48,000 | Point-in-Time Benar=50,000 (eff_ts= 0)\n  ts=25 | Latest-Snapshot Bug=48,000 | Point-in-Time Benar=50,000 (eff_ts= 0)\n  ts=42 | Latest-Snapshot Bug=48,000 | Point-in-Time Benar=42,000 (eff_ts=30)\n  ts=68 | Latest-Snapshot Bug=48,000 | Point-in-Time Benar=35,000 (eff_ts=60)\n  ts=95 | Latest-Snapshot Bug=48,000 | Point-in-Time Benar=48,000 (eff_ts=90)",
          "explanation": "Membuktikan kebocoran rolling(7) tanpa shift(1) (RMSE palsu 24.36 -> runtuh ke 36.41 live vs kausal stabil 29.94), menangkap delta bocor 504.52 vs 0.00 lewat uji perturbasi masa depan, serta mendemonstrasikan Point-in-Time backward pd.merge_asof.",
