          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.feature_selection import SelectKBest, f_classif, mutual_info_classif, mutual_info_regression\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nfrom sklearn.metrics import roc_auc_score\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2642)\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# mRMR (Minimum Redundancy Maximum Relevance) vs Univariate Filter pada Fitur Kolinear\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nn = 900\n# 3 sumber informasi ortogonal sejati: s0 (kuat), s1 (sedang), s2 (sedang)\ns0 = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n)\ns1 = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n)\ns2 = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n)\n\n# Buat 4 klon kolinear dari s0 (rho ~ 0.96) + 3 fitur noise acak -> total 10 fitur!\nc0_a = s0 + rng.normal(0.0, 0.22, size=n)\nc0_b = s0 + rng.normal(0.0, 0.25, size=n)\nc0_c = s0 + rng.normal(0.0, 0.28, size=n)\nc0_d = s0 + rng.normal(0.0, 0.30, size=n)\nnoise = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n, 3))\n\nX = np.column_stack([s0, c0_a, c0_b, c0_c, c0_d, s1, s2, noise])\nfeat_names = [\"s0_core\", \"clone_a\", \"clone_b\", \"clone_c\", \"clone_d\", \"s1_orth\", \"s2_orth\", \"n0\", \"n1\", \"n2\"]\n\nlogit = 1.55 * s0 + 1.15 * s1 - 1.10 * s2\ny = (rng.uniform(size=n) < (1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-logit)))).astype(int)\n\nX_tr, X_te, y_tr, y_te = train_test_split(X, y, test_size=0.30, stratify=y, random_state=42)\n\n# Anggaran fitur produksi ketat: hanya boleh memilih K = 3 fitur (SLA latensi rendah!)\nK = 3\n\n# 1) SelectKBest (F-ANOVA) & SelectKBest (Mutual Information) - hanya ukur relevansi!\nsel_f = SelectKBest(f_classif, k=K).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\nidx_f = list(np.where(sel_f.get_support())[0])\n\nmi_rel = mutual_info_classif(X_tr, y_tr, random_state=42)\nidx_mi_uni = list(np.argsort(mi_rel)[::-1][:K])\n\n# 2) Implementasi mRMR-MID (Mutual Information Difference) memakai MI antar-fitur\nd = X_tr.shape[1]\nred_mat = np.zeros((d, d), dtype=float)\nfor i in range(d):\n    red_mat[i] = mutual_info_regression(X_tr, X_tr[:, i], random_state=42)\nred_mat = 0.5 * (red_mat + red_mat.T)\n\nselected_mrmr: list[int] = []\nremaining = list(range(d))\nfor step in range(K):\n    if step == 0:\n        best_j = int(max(remaining, key=lambda j: mi_rel[j]))\n    else:\n        best_j = int(max(\n            remaining,\n            key=lambda j: mi_rel[j] - float(np.mean([red_mat[j, s] for s in selected_mrmr])),\n        ))\n    selected_mrmr.append(best_j)\n    remaining.remove(best_j)\n\ndef eval_subset(idxs: list[int]) -> float:\n    sc = StandardScaler()\n    Z_tr = sc.fit_transform(X_tr[:, idxs])\n    Z_te = sc.transform(X_te[:, idxs])\n    clf = LogisticRegression(max_iter=500).fit(Z_tr, y_tr)\n    return float(roc_auc_score(y_te, clf.predict_proba(Z_te)[:, 1]))\n\nprint(\"=== Perbandingan Seleksi K=3 Fitur pada Dataset Berklon Kolinear (rho ~ 0.96) ===\")\nprint(f\"1) Univariate F-ANOVA   : {[feat_names[i] for i in idx_f]} -> Test ROC-AUC = {eval_subset(idx_f):.4f}\")\nprint(f\"2) Univariate MI Top-3  : {[feat_names[i] for i in idx_mi_uni]} -> Test ROC-AUC = {eval_subset(idx_mi_uni):.4f}\")\nprint(f\"3) mRMR-MID (Rel - Red) : {[feat_names[i] for i in selected_mrmr]} -> Test ROC-AUC = {eval_subset(selected_mrmr):.4f}\")\nprint(f\"4) Oracle Semua 10 Fitur: (baseline penuh)                   -> Test ROC-AUC = {eval_subset(list(range(d))):.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Perbandingan Seleksi K=3 Fitur pada Dataset Berklon Kolinear (rho ~ 0.96) ===\n1) Univariate F-ANOVA   : ['s0_core', 'clone_a', 'clone_b'] -> Test ROC-AUC = 0.7953\n2) Univariate MI Top-3  : ['clone_c', 'clone_a', 's0_core'] -> Test ROC-AUC = 0.7950\n3) mRMR-MID (Rel - Red) : ['clone_c', 's2_orth', 's1_orth'] -> Test ROC-AUC = 0.9078\n4) Oracle Semua 10 Fitur: (baseline penuh)                   -> Test ROC-AUC = 0.9109",
          "actualOutput": "=== Perbandingan Seleksi K=3 Fitur pada Dataset Berklon Kolinear (rho ~ 0.96) ===\n1) Univariate F-ANOVA   : ['s0_core', 'clone_a', 'clone_b'] -> Test ROC-AUC = 0.7953\n2) Univariate MI Top-3  : ['clone_c', 'clone_a', 's0_core'] -> Test ROC-AUC = 0.7950\n3) mRMR-MID (Rel - Red) : ['clone_c', 's2_orth', 's1_orth'] -> Test ROC-AUC = 0.9078\n4) Oracle Semua 10 Fitur: (baseline penuh)                   -> Test ROC-AUC = 0.9109",
          "explanation": "Membuktikan SelectKBest F-ANOVA dan MI univariat menyia-nyiakan slot K=3 pada klon s0 (Test ROC-AUC=0.795), sedangkan mRMR-MID menangkap ketiga sumber sinyal ortogonal dan mengangkat Test ROC-AUC ke 0.9078 (nyaris menyamai oracle 10 fitur 0.9109).",
