          "id": "code-ml-26-4-ch26_4_diag",
          "title": "Production Audit: Null Importance (Bias MDI) & Bencana Selection-Before-CV di Pure Noise",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "26_4_null_importance_and_selection_leakage.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier\nfrom sklearn.feature_selection import SelectKBest, f_classif\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nfrom sklearn.metrics import roc_auc_score\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import StratifiedKFold, cross_val_score\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2643)\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Production Audit 1: Null Importance Melucuti Bias Kardinalitas MDI pada Random Forest\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nn = 650\n# Fitur asli biner (kardinalitas=2, sinyal nyata!) vs fitur noise kontinu (650 nilai unik!)\nreal_bin = rng.integers(0, 2, size=n).astype(float)\nreal_ord = rng.integers(0, 4, size=n).astype(float)\nnoise_high_card_1 = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n)   # 650 nilai unik, 0 korelasi dengan y!\nnoise_high_card_2 = rng.uniform(0.0, 1e6, size=n)  # 650 nilai unik, 0 korelasi dengan y!\nnoise_bin = rng.integers(0, 2, size=n).astype(float)\n\nX = np.column_stack([real_bin, real_ord, noise_high_card_1, noise_high_card_2, noise_bin])\nfnames = [\"real_bin(K=2)\", \"real_ord(K=4)\", \"noise_norm(K=650)\", \"noise_id(K=650)\", \"noise_bin(K=2)\"]\n\nlogit = -1.4 + 1.45 * real_bin + 0.78 * real_ord\ny = (rng.uniform(size=n) < (1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-logit)))).astype(int)\n\n# MDI Aktual (pohon dalam max_depth=None memperparah bias fitur berkardinalitas tinggi!)\nrf_actual = RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=50, max_depth=None, random_state=42, n_jobs=1).fit(X, y)\nactual_imp = rf_actual.feature_importances_\n\n# Distribusi Null Importance: acak label y sebanyak B=20 kali\nB = 20\nnull_imps = np.zeros((B, X.shape[1]), dtype=float)\nfor b in range(B):\n    y_perm = rng.permutation(y)\n    rf_null = RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=40, max_depth=None, random_state=200 + b, n_jobs=1).fit(X, y_perm)\n    null_imps[b] = rf_null.feature_importances_\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Null Importance Audit (B=20 Permutasi Target) vs Bias MDI ===\")\nfor j, name in enumerate(fnames):\n    q75_null = float(np.percentile(null_imps[:, j], 75))\n    score_log = float(np.log((actual_imp[j] + 1e-4) / (q75_null + 1e-4)))\n    p_emp = float((1 + np.sum(null_imps[:, j] >= actual_imp[j])) / (B + 1))\n    verdict = \"KEEP\" if (p_emp <= 0.10 and score_log > 0.25) else \"DROP_NOISE\"\n    print(f\"  {name:18s} | MDI_Actual={actual_imp[j]:.4f} | Null_Q75={q75_null:.4f} | LogScore={score_log:+.3f} | p_emp={p_emp:.3f} | {verdict}\")\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Production Audit 2: Bencana Selection-Before-CV pada Data Pure Noise (N=160, D=800)\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nX_pure_noise = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(160, 800))\ny_pure_noise = rng.integers(0, 2, size=160)\ncv = StratifiedKFold(n_splits=5, shuffle=True, random_state=42)\n\n# BUG: SelectKBest dijalankan di SELURUH dataset sebelum cross_val_score!\nX_leaked_top20 = SelectKBest(f_classif, k=20).fit_transform(X_pure_noise, y_pure_noise)\nauc_leaked_cv = float(cross_val_score(\n    Pipeline([(\"sc\", StandardScaler()), (\"clf\", LogisticRegression(max_iter=500))]),\n    X_leaked_top20, y_pure_noise, cv=cv, scoring=\"roc_auc\",\n).mean())\n\n# BENAR: SelectKBest dibungkus di DALAM Pipeline sehingga terisolasi per fold CV!\npipe_clean = Pipeline([\n    (\"sel\", SelectKBest(f_classif, k=20)),\n    (\"sc\", StandardScaler()),\n    (\"clf\", LogisticRegression(max_iter=500)),\n])\nauc_clean_cv = float(cross_val_score(pipe_clean, X_pure_noise, y_pure_noise, cv=cv, scoring=\"roc_auc\").mean())\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Audit Selection-Before-CV pada 100% Pure Noise (N=160, D=800, Sinyal Sejati=0) ===\")\nprint(f\"[ANTI-PATTERN] SelectKBest Sebelum CV -> 5-Fold ROC-AUC = {auc_leaked_cv:.4f}  <-- ILUSI SINYAL PALSU!\")\nprint(f\"[SAFE PIPELINE] SelectKBest Di Dalam CV -> 5-Fold ROC-AUC = {auc_clean_cv:.4f}  <-- JUJUR (~0.50 ACAK!)\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Null Importance Audit (B=20 Permutasi Target) vs Bias MDI ===\n  real_bin(K=2)      | MDI_Actual=0.0869 | Null_Q75=0.0344 | LogScore=+0.924 | p_emp=0.048 | KEEP\n  real_ord(K=4)      | MDI_Actual=0.1494 | Null_Q75=0.0788 | LogScore=+0.639 | p_emp=0.048 | KEEP\n  noise_norm(K=650)  | MDI_Actual=0.3447 | Null_Q75=0.4379 | LogScore=-0.239 | p_emp=1.000 | DROP_NOISE\n  noise_id(K=650)    | MDI_Actual=0.3869 | Null_Q75=0.4388 | LogScore=-0.126 | p_emp=1.000 | DROP_NOISE\n  noise_bin(K=2)     | MDI_Actual=0.0320 | Null_Q75=0.0330 | LogScore=-0.031 | p_emp=0.429 | DROP_NOISE\n\n=== 2. Audit Selection-Before-CV pada 100% Pure Noise (N=160, D=800, Sinyal Sejati=0) ===\n[ANTI-PATTERN] SelectKBest Sebelum CV -> 5-Fold ROC-AUC = 0.8568  <-- ILUSI SINYAL PALSU!\n[SAFE PIPELINE] SelectKBest Di Dalam CV -> 5-Fold ROC-AUC = 0.4381  <-- JUJUR (~0.50 ACAK!)",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Null Importance Audit (B=20 Permutasi Target) vs Bias MDI ===\n  real_bin(K=2)      | MDI_Actual=0.0869 | Null_Q75=0.0344 | LogScore=+0.924 | p_emp=0.048 | KEEP\n  real_ord(K=4)      | MDI_Actual=0.1494 | Null_Q75=0.0788 | LogScore=+0.639 | p_emp=0.048 | KEEP\n  noise_norm(K=650)  | MDI_Actual=0.3447 | Null_Q75=0.4379 | LogScore=-0.239 | p_emp=1.000 | DROP_NOISE\n  noise_id(K=650)    | MDI_Actual=0.3869 | Null_Q75=0.4388 | LogScore=-0.126 | p_emp=1.000 | DROP_NOISE\n  noise_bin(K=2)     | MDI_Actual=0.0320 | Null_Q75=0.0330 | LogScore=-0.031 | p_emp=0.429 | DROP_NOISE\n\n=== 2. Audit Selection-Before-CV pada 100% Pure Noise (N=160, D=800, Sinyal Sejati=0) ===\n[ANTI-PATTERN] SelectKBest Sebelum CV -> 5-Fold ROC-AUC = 0.8568  <-- ILUSI SINYAL PALSU!\n[SAFE PIPELINE] SelectKBest Di Dalam CV -> 5-Fold ROC-AUC = 0.4381  <-- JUJUR (~0.50 ACAK!)",
          "explanation": "Membuktikan MDI mentah menempatkan noise_id(K=650)=0.3869 jauh di atas sinyal biner real_bin(K=2)=0.0869 lalu melucutinya 100% lewat Null Importance (B=20 permutasi), serta mereproduksi ilusi ROC-AUC 0.8568 akibat SelectKBest sebelum CV pada 100% pure noise.",
